                                "sense_id": "5d121cb3-f7c6-340b-ae9d-d370523e1288",
                                "text": "Before that, students and professors could date whomever we wanted; the next day we were off-limits to one another—verboten, traife, dangerous (and perhaps, therefore, all the more alluring)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31a58199-f365-4abd-8b03-1f20428c03d2",
                                "sense_id": "5d121cb3-f7c6-340b-ae9d-d370523e1288",
                                "text": "Or was it because he [Mark Zuckerberg] has since been steeped in the relentless positivity of Silicon Valley, where it is verboten to imagine a bad outcome?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
